[statement]
A real name is decided before a provided one whatever its number of
candidates: `x`, offered at 1.0 and 2.0, is decided first, for 2.0, which
needs `p2`, and `p2` then answers `v`, which `b` lists first.

[repository]
P:b
V:1
D:v x

P:p1
V:1
p:v
k:100

P:p2
V:1
p:v
k:10

P:x
V:1.0

P:x
V:2.0
D:p2


[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p2 1
install x 2.0
install b 1
